5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I worry about social friction. We need to know how past arrangements failed.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I’m curious if the current spots match where people actually park.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The morning rush is chaotic. I need to see the physical reality of the rows.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Everyone asks about costs. I want to see the actual financial history.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Who maintains this? I need to understand the ongoing administrative burden.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, the ledger might show if we have funds for new rules.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, if the spots are bad, maybe we need a different system.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, I’ll check the rain exposure. It affects bike condition.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, if it’s too much work, we shouldn’t do it.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, I’ll look at the treasurer’s file to see the workload.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I’ll check the complaint log to see what went wrong before.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I’ll look at the sticker register to see who rides daily.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I’ll watch the morning departures to see the shoving match.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
