35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The complaint log shows nine issues last year, all ignored.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,The sticker register shows some flats have three bikes.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,I watched four mornings. People shift bikes to get out.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The ledger is empty for capital work. The ward park costs 2,600 yen.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The treasurer spends three hours a month on cash. It’s a lot.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, if we charge, we need money. The ledger is thin.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, if it’s a shoving match, maybe shared racks help?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, shared racks might mean fighting for the top spot.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, three hours a month is too much for one person.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, exactly. We need a system that doesn’t require constant management.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The minutes show the same flats held spots for years. No review.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,The rain exposure is bad past the downpipe. Saddles stay wet.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The rain is a problem. But the morning rush is worse.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The ward park has a waitlist. We are lucky to have spaces.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The display frame takes twenty seconds to load. It’s physical work.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
