60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A charges money. Option B is a lottery. Option C is shared.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"I like Option C. No one owns a spot, so no resentment.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option C might cause more morning chaos. Option B is fair.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option A brings in money. But the ledger is empty.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option A requires billing. That’s three hours a month. Too much.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, if we avoid billing, Option B or C.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, shared racks are open. No one is stuck.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, but who cleans the racks? The trial showed effort.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, Option B is simple. No money, no work.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, Option B is the least administrative burden.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"Option B prevents the ""same flats"" issue from the minutes.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Yumi,,Option B is fair. Everyone has a chance.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,Option B is reasonable. It stops the morning shoving match.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,Option B is cost-effective. No levies needed.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Toshio,,Option B requires no monthly reconciliation. I support it.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
